Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}就像金刚
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.74,0:00:43.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最难的十大任务 正好让我扬名立万统领天下
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.96,0:00:47.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我停不下来 怪物转生 从零转生 豪赌一把
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}每次下注我都倾家荡产
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}但我根本不在意
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.34,0:00:50.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.22,0:00:52.94,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}走在街上毛线帽戴好
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.87,0:00:55.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.28,0:00:59.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.88,0:01:01.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.13,0:01:08.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.91,0:01:13.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.17,0:01:15.51,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.53,0:01:17.20,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\(960,1065,960,1130,1570,1670)}{\t(500,550,\fscx125\fscy60)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.64,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\(960,1040,960,1065,1020,1120)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.79,0:01:19.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.62,0:01:21.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.54,0:01:25.23,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\(960,1065,960,1130,3590,3690)}{\t(2130,2180,\fscx125\fscy60)}我们浴火而生在当下
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.72,0:01:24.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\(960,1040)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.73,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\(960,1040,960,1065,90,190)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.91,0:01:28.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.06,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们浴火而生
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.10,0:01:32.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}前往下片天地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,

